            "review_title": "Review at Banh Canh Ghe Muoi Ot Xanh",
            "review_text": "Lee S\nColchester, Vermont1079 contributions\n0\nExcellent Meal\nNov 2016 • Couples\nWe had a great time at Banh Canh Gue Muoi Ot Xanth. We were part of a group on a Back Of The Bike food tour through HCMC. The crab soup here was delicious with crispy fried rice puffs. The restaurant is really nice inside with lots of fresh live seafood on display. I would definitely go back here and I give this restaurant my recommendation.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 4, 2017",
